    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Three-condition gate",
      "items": [
        "The token is enrolled in rewards, the epoch's treasury took in revenue, and votes were cast; miss one and nothing is allocated",
        "When one is missing, the treasury amount rolls over in full and is allocated again next epoch",
        "The allocation ratio is 25% by default and can be adjusted by governance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Only the preceding epoch",
      "items": [
        "After settlement, claim actively within the claim window; only your own share",
        "Only the immediately preceding epoch counts; miss it and the amount rolls into the treasury, with no reissue",
